        "notes": "[Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) provides a decent AP boost on top of providing a faster B.O.B. which is never a bad thing.  [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) also bumps AP while granting more Lifesteal, further ensuring your survivability. \n\nIf you're *really* concerned with staying alive, you can swap [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) for [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) to give you even more endurance.  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) and [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) are decent options for if you have extra cash and either want more consistent damage or want more late round ability power.",
