        "notes": "[Double Barrelled](item_962b847f-140d-41a4-9bac-ddcdb088951e) will increase your mobility as well as provide additional opportunities to deal burn damage. You can also burst people down more easily if they're already burning, although be careful using Coach Gun purely offensively as it is still your only escape tool.\n\n [Reload Therapy](item_1d85105f-1ec7-4ec7-a56d-f273c09f4b3e) should only be taken at this level if you are *extremely* concerned about getting dived and are desperate for any help you can get, but it is a decent survival tool if you do find yourself in that situation.\n\n [Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262),   [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) , and  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) all empower your cooldowns further and make your burn damage even more potent.",
